  "ref": "ACT.11.29",
  "review_notes": [
    "The ASV recasts καθὼς εὐπορεῖτό τις as every man according to his ability: ἕκαστος takes every man, εὐπορεῖτο the noun ability, and τις is left unrepresented. Giving every man to τις and leaving ἕκαστος empty remains defensible.",
    "εἰς left unrepresented because relief compresses the whole phrase (rule 36)."
